  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Former editor of a Columbian fashion magazine, Orchid began treatment at Rhodes Island following Oripathy. She expressed her desire to become an Operator, passed the examination battery and was assigned to Reserve Op Team A6 as the squad leader. She manages the team and provides support with her Arts in combat.",
        "zh": "前哥伦比亚某时尚杂志编辑，感染矿石病后进入罗德岛接受治疗。出于本人的意愿，在通过干员测试后，成为罗德岛的一员，被分配到预备行动组A6担任小队队长。负责整支小队的统筹，在战斗时，使用法术为队员提供支援。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 6% \nInfection is expected to spread given the current course. Regular observation and management required. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.23u/L \nOperator Orchid displays conspicuous symptoms, but has cooperated with the treatment plan and has minimized the spread of the infection.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】6%\n以这个势头发展下去，感染将匀速蔓延，需要保持定期观察与控制。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.23u/L\n干员梓兰有着明显的感染者症状，不过本人十分配合治疗，病情扩散速度已经被压制到一个很低的水平。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Captain of Reserve Op Team A6, yearning to return to a normal life. \nHaving previously been an office worker, Orchid is one of the most 'ordinary' Rhodes Islanders, but finds herself constantly troubled by the more colorful characters on her team. Her title might be captain, but she's more like the squad nanny.",
        "zh": "渴望回归日常生活的预备行动组A6队长。\n作为前OL，常识水平即使在罗德岛中也称得上顶尖，因而经常被手下几个怪人搞得焦头烂额。说是队长，实质上更像是他们的保姆。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The former fashion magazine editor still has a nose for the trendy. She never bandwagons onto a fad, preferring to keep to her own vision. The way she dresses usually sets the style for the season at Rhodes Island. \nMore importantly, she knows all the tricks to cover up all the superficial symptoms of Oripathy, keeping the Infected looking the same as they ever did, and even bringing out their individual charms--just as she did for herself. She has been a godsend to many Oripathy sufferers, especially the ladies. \nAs such, Miss Orchid has become an icon to some of the girls on the island.",
        "zh": "担任过时尚杂志编辑的梓兰小姐，在时尚领域有着敏锐的嗅觉，而且并不盲从，拥有属于自己独到的眼光，她的穿着往往就是罗德岛的潮流指向标。\n更重要的是，她能够通过各种精妙的手法，在掩盖体表矿石病特征的同时，保持一个人的整体形象，甚至将之作为展示其魅力的手段——正如她对自己做的那样。这对于许多矿石病的患者，尤其是接受过现代社会熏陶的女性来说，都是一件求之不得的事。\n因而，在罗德岛的部分女孩子心中，梓兰小姐有着独特的地位。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A modern city girl like Orchid would have never volunteered herself for a highly dangerous job like an that of an Operator. \nBut treatment at Rhodes Island isn't free (though there are discounts and payment plans), and she did lose her job. Ultimately, after a battery of exams, she decided to accept the position. \nOf course, if she knew she was to lead the freaks on A6, she probably would have had second thoughts.",
        "zh": "原本，梓兰小姐这样的都市女性，是断然不会主动选择干员这样的高危职业。\n不过，在罗德岛接受治疗毕竟不是免费的（虽然有各种优惠措施和分期手段），而她又因为矿石病失去了工作，最终，在尝试了一段时间后，她决定接受这份新工作。\n当然，如果她当时知道自己将要带领A6这样一群怪人的话，说不定会当场拒绝。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "But when all is said and done, Orchid knows better than anyone that even though A6 is a freak show, they all have their hearts in the right place. \nher egotistical but sincere Midnight, her deadly but well-meaning Popukar, her icy but caring Spot, and... then there's Catapult... Right, let's not talk about her. In any case, Orchid treasures her squadmates.",
        "zh": "归根结底，梓兰小姐是最知道A6虽然是一群怪人，却没有一个是坏人这一点的。\n浮夸却真挚的月见夜，冒失但没有恶意的泡普卡，外冷内热的斑点，空爆……好吧，先不管她，总之，这些人，其实都是她的宝物。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
